{
  "script": "In a world... where one tiny bolt... has absolutely no chill. A shock is coming. And your electronics would like a word. Introducing... Shock Prediction Workbench. Separation bolts. Linear shaped charges. One place to assess the aftermath. Load the source. Trace the path. Compare the component environment. Direct prediction. Measured ratios. Distance models. Path factors. Time-domain isolation. Try a new location. Check the margins. And when the isolator runs out of travel... the tool calls it out. Because, it'll probably be fine... is not a transfer function. Shock Prediction Workbench. Big drama. Better evidence. Now available to the team. No actual hardware was harmed in the making of this trailer. The demo data, however... are extremely dramatic.",
